a nella supereroina \"Ladybug\". Ma Marinette non sa che anche Adrien ha un'identità nascosta, \"Chat Noir\". Ignari delle reciproche identità, la grintosa e indipendente Ladybug e il presuntuoso Chat Noir si incontrano nel corso delle loro missioni.","tagline":"Il destino del mondo è nelle loro mani."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Miraculous: Ladybug & Cat Noir, The Movie","overview":"After a guardian of magical jewels turns an awkward girl and a popular boy into superheroes, they can never reveal their identities — even to each other.","tagline":"The fate of the world is in their hands."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"La super-héroïne, qui a conquis le cœur de millions de fans à travers le monde, débarque pour la première fois au cinéma ! Ladybug va devoir unir ses forces avec Chat Noir, le charismatique justicier masqué qui n'a pas sa langue dans sa poche, pour affronter le Papillon et sa horde de super-vilains, alors que ceux-ci menacent de détruire Paris. Mais, alors que les deux héros se rapprochent, Marinette ignore que derrière son mystérieux complice se cache Adrien, le camarade de classe dont elle est amoureuse","tagline":"Plus forts ensemble."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqEvzlrdDbcCvqLn66M9uBsNGNP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iEFuHjqrE059SmflBva1JzDJutE.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":496450,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqEvzlrdDbcCvqLn66M9uBsNGNP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dqEvzlrdDbcCvqLn66M9uBsNGNP.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqEvzlrdDbcCvqLn66M9uBsNGNP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dqEvzlrdDbcCvqLn66M9uBsNGNP.jpg","language"